# The granted flashback changes the cost and the zone, not the timing (CR 702.34a, 117.1a): Snapcaster Mage flashed in during
# Bot2's end step gives Imperial Seal flashback, but the Seal is a sorcery, so Bot1 may not cast it then (refused). The
# effect lasts until end of turn (CR 514.2): in Bot1's main phase on turn 3 it is gone, and the Seal is refused again. The
# same-turn cast in a main phase is the existing and the other Snapcaster scenario.

